stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> PretrainedLLM
    PretrainedLLM --> DataPrep: prepare labeled task-specific dataset
    DataPrep --> FullFineTuning: update all model weights
    DataPrep --> ParameterEfficientFineTuning: update a small subset via LoRA or QLoRA
    FullFineTuning --> EvaluatedModel
    ParameterEfficientFineTuning --> EvaluatedModel
    EvaluatedModel --> [*]: deployed for inference

    note right of FullFineTuning
        High compute and memory cost.
        Every parameter is updated.
    end note

    note right of ParameterEfficientFineTuning
        Low compute and memory cost.
        Only adapter parameters are updated,
        base model stays frozen.
    end note